{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Old World is Gone. Can You Build a New One?\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swarm consumed civilization. Now, survivors cling to life in \u200b<strong>\u200b</strong>rusted strongholds<strong>\u200b</strong>\u200b. But you\u2014\u200b<strong>\u200b</strong>guided by a forgotten starship<strong>\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014dive into the ruins, leading a squad to \u200b<strong>\u200bscavenge, fight, and uncover the truth.\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bScavenge or Die\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fog hides monsters... and miracles. \u200b\u200bLost technology\u200b\u200b waits in the wreckage\u2014use it to tip the scales.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bAdapt or Be Overrun\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies strike without warning. \u200b<strong>\u200bNo static defenses\u2014</strong>push forward, fall back, outmaneuver.<strong>\u200b</strong>\u200b Every map is a new nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bJury-Rigged Warfare\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets are \u200b<strong>\u200bammo, not assets\u200b</strong>\u200b. Drag them, break them, modify them. \u200b\u200bYour only rule: survive.\u200b\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>War Machine\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just a soldier\u2014you\u2019re \u200b<strong>\u200ban engineer, a strategist, a leader\u200b</strong>\u200b. Research, craft, and \u200b<strong>\u200bturn scraps into salvation.\u200b</strong>\u200b</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686840?t=1755261716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686840/05860368e05b4592186f7d98a0eb8c634d38c7e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755261716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps