ng>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets are \u200b<strong>\u200bammo, not assets\u200b</strong>\u200b. Drag them, break them, modify them. \u200b\u200bYour only rule: survive.\u200b\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>War Machine\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just a soldier\u2014you\u2019re \u200b<strong>\u200ban engineer, a strategist, a leader\u200b</strong>\u200b. Research, craft, and \u200b<strong>\u200bturn scraps into salvation.\u200b</strong>\u200b</p>","developers":["YETS"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686840/fe8cf057322ac56ac46b5c0073bcf5dfd2aab6d9/header.jpg?t=1755261716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686840/1400397437/03f63573ae83df317a1f6c806070bb6ff1173cee/1750402782/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749474772","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686840/1400397437/03f63573ae83df317a1f6c806070bb6ff1173cee/1750402782/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749474772","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3686840/1400397437/03f63573ae83df317a1f6c806070bb6ff1173cee/1750402782/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749474772","id":257151141,"name":"\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151141/0b49cec9b05a5585a832b37fad346886c373038c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749474772"}],"name":"Under the Ruin","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u5e9f\u589f\u9632\u7ebf - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$5.99</span> $5.09 USD","p